# Runtime variables are configured in Cloudflare. Keep this file as a names-only template.
# For local Worker development, put a new random secret in ignored .dev.vars.
# BETTER_AUTH_SECRET=<generate a random value with at least 32 bytes of entropy>
# SITE_ORIGIN=<exact local or preview origin, for example http://localhost:8787>
# D1 binding: DB (configured in wrangler.jsonc; never put credentials here)
